    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A grandma has lost her cat.</strong><br><strong>You are John Parkour.</strong><br><strong>Time to climb.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the mischievous &quot;John Cat&quot; across floating islands and absurd obstacles in this short, funky, and fast-paced first-person parkour adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master momentum and unlock wild new movement abilities like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnet Dash</strong> \u2013 zip through the air to magnetic orbs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/40c550bcd2eced2967d960f00930c69f.poster.avif?t=1755506009\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/40c550bcd2eced2967d960f00930c69f.webm?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sling Gun</strong> \u2013 shoot mid-air switches to reveal paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/49f588cb46b162fdf3201ff0a417bc53.poster.avif?t=1755506009\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/49f588cb46b162fdf3201ff0a417bc53.webm?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/49f588cb46b162fdf3201ff0a417bc53.mp4?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Jump</strong> \u2013 reach new heights and correct your flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/ccdfed2cc046239c30325e8bc9aed23f.poster.avif?t=1755506009\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/ccdfed2cc046239c30325e8bc9aed23f.webm?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/ccdfed2cc046239c30325e8bc9aed23f.mp4?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grapple</strong> \u2013 swing between objects like a spider</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/97a83db86caa79479bb72b22746cc655.poster.avif?t=1755506009\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/97a83db86caa79479bb72b22746cc655.webm?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/97a83db86caa79479bb72b22746cc655.mp4?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and upgrades to your existing abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a rage game\u2014checkpoints are placed throughout the level, and the game features aim assist to keep the flow smooth and fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun-focused first-person platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable abilities that evolve your movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflex-based challenges requiring precise timing and aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time trial mode with your ghost cat as the rival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generous checkpointing and aim assist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u20132 hours of tightly designed, high-energy gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built entirely by one person with love (and stupidity)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She just wanted her cat back.<br>Now you\u2019re a legend.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A grandma has lost her cat.</strong><br><strong>You are John Parkour.</strong><br><strong>Time to climb.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the mischievous &quot;John Cat&quot; across floating islands and absurd obstacles in this short, funky, and fast-paced first-person parkour adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master momentum and unlock wild new movement abilities like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnet Dash</strong> \u2013 zip through the air to magnetic orbs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/40c550bcd2eced2967d960f00930c69f.poster.avif?t=1755506009\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/40c550bcd2eced2967d960f00930c69f.webm?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sling Gun</strong> \u2013 shoot mid-air switches to reveal paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/49f588cb46b162fdf3201ff0a417bc53.poster.avif?t=1755506009\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/49f588cb46b162fdf3201ff0a417bc53.webm?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/49f588cb46b162fdf3201ff0a417bc53.mp4?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Jump</strong> \u2013 reach new heights and correct your flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/ccdfed2cc046239c30325e8bc9aed23f.poster.avif?t=1755506009\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/ccdfed2cc046239c30325e8bc9aed23f.webm?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/ccdfed2cc046239c30325e8bc9aed23f.mp4?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grapple</strong> \u2013 swing between objects like a spider</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/97a83db86caa79479bb72b22746cc655.poster.avif?t=1755506009\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/97a83db86caa79479bb72b22746cc655.webm?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686450/extras/97a83db86caa79479bb72b22746cc655.mp4?t=1755506009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and upgrades to your existing abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a rage game\u2014checkpoints are placed throughout the level, and the game features aim assist to keep the flow smooth and fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun-focused first-person platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable abilities that evolve your movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflex-based challenges requiring precise timing and aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time trial mode with your ghost cat as the rival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generous checkpointing and aim assist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u20132 hours of tightly designed, high-energy gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built entirely by one person with love (and stupidity)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She just wanted her cat back.<br>Now you\u2019re a legend.</p>",
